    "body": "So, ok status will be filtered for \"no-cors\" fetches?\r\n\r\n> If raceNetworkRequestResponse’s [status](https://fetch.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-response-status) is [ok status](https://fetch.spec.whatwg.org/#ok-status), then:\r\n\r\nWhat about updating this paragraph to refer [internal response](https://fetch.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-internal-response)?  Not sure referring the ok status in internal response is concerned for information leaks, but there're a couple of lines referring internal response in the ServiceWorker spec.",
